  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "values",
      "title_zh": "牌点",
      "title_en": "Card values",
      "source_zh": "讲义 Card Values",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "assets/handouts/card-values.jpg",
          "alt": "讲义 Card Values"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "2 到 9 按点数。10、J、Q、K 都是 10。A 是 1 或 11。"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "牌",
            "点数"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "2–9",
              "面值"
            ],
            [
              "10 / J / Q / K",
              "10"
            ],
            [
              "Ace",
              "1 或 11"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "soft-hard",
      "title_zh": "软牌和硬牌",
      "title_en": "Soft and hard hands",
      "source_zh": "讲义 Card Values，白板 19 手",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "assets/handouts/whiteboard.jpg",
          "alt": "白板点数练习"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "en": "When an ace in the dealers/players hand can be counted as 11 or 1.",
          "zh": "软牌：这手牌里的 A 可以算 11，也可以算 1。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "讲义例子：Ace and a 4；Ace, 4 and a 3；Ace and a 9。软牌再补一张不会马上爆，因为 A 可以改算 1。"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "en": "Hard hands have no varying Ace value.",
          "zh": "硬牌：A 的点数不能再变。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "两种情况：没有 A；或者 A 算 11 会爆，所以只能算 1。例子：Ace, 5 and an 8 是硬 14；10 and a 7 是硬 17；Ace, 3 and a Jack 是硬 14。"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "gap",
          "text": "两张牌的 A+10 才是 blackjack。分牌之后拿到的 A+10 只是 21，不按 3 to 2。"
        }
      ]
    },
