    {
      "id": "splits",
      "title_zh": "分牌和加倍",
      "title_en": "Splits and doubling down",
      "source_zh": "讲义 Splits and Doubling Down",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "assets/handouts/splits.jpg",
          "alt": "讲义分牌和加倍"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "en": "A player can split their first two cards that are of equal value.",
          "zh": "前两张点数相同才能分。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "必须再放一份和原注相同的注。最多分 3 次，一共 4 手。A 只能分一次，每手只给 1 张。分牌后可以加倍，但分开的 A 不能加倍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "任意两张都可以加倍，blackjack 除外。加倍金额可以到原注为止，不能超过。少于原注要喊 doubling down for less。不常见的加倍要喊出来，例子是 doubling down on a hard 12。对子要先问是 split 还是 double。"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "en": "The double down bet must be moved to the right side of the original bet.",
          "zh": "加倍的筹码放到原注右侧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "check",
          "text": "分牌那段也印着 All double down bets must be moved to the right side of the original bet。照原文留着，标成待确认。不要用网上的规则改掉它。"
        },
        {
          "type": "calls",
          "audio_ids": [
            "d-double-less",
            "d-double-hard-12",
            "d-split-or-double"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
